[ti:Visitor song]
[ar:nishal21 and visitors]
[00:00.00]Someone stopped by late on a quiet night
[00:05.50]left a single note and went on their way
[00:10.28]I never got their name until the credits
[00:15.50]now it plays here every single day
[00:20.16]I was painting a picture (@nishal21)
[00:25.14]One note at a time
[00:30.70]from people passing through
[00:35.70]a name beside a line
[00:40.74]and part of it is you
[00:45.94]Leave yours and the song gets one beat longer
